Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Carbonyl: include private/base/SkAPI.h in SkBase64.h for
 M148

SkBase64 moved from include/utils/ to src/base/ in M148-era Skia and
no longer transitively pulls in SkTypes.h. Add the explicit SkAPI.h
include so the SK_API decorator the carbonyl patch adds is defined.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
